      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think the plane contact would be a great addition. \n\nA suggestion for the Reciever type could be Forcefield. This setting could be the distance (could be Unity units or a relative scale set in the Reciever) of any sender going behind the forcefield's directional plane. I think it would be a nice complement to the Physbones plane collider. \n\nConstant would just be any sender going past the directional plane.\n\nMaybe one could be Count, which just gives the number of separate senders going beyond the plane.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
