  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-08-04T03:23:47.108Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Many avatars use contacts set 3m to use them as as pseudo plane contact, as this limit is the default.\n\nHowever, since this is the limit, they cannot be scaled up any longer using the avatar scaling system and will break function on some avatars that depend on the position and scale to be very specific.\n\n**Fixes:**\n\n- Removing the 3m limit.\n\n- Keeping the 3m limit exist, but make it scalable with avatar scaling.\n\nHowever, if (for security reasons?) you want to keep the limit on both ends. At least replace it with an actual plane contact.\n\n**Plane contact**\n\nWorks like a plane collider where a plane is defined from position and rotation and then a maximum perpendicular distance to determine the maximum float value.",
